{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel that tells a comedic story about a campus hero, and it also includes some puzzle mini-games. We hope this work will bring smiles to everyone while also raising awareness about the importance of standing up against school bullying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows Lu Yunjie, a middle school student who accidentally witnesses his classmate Ling Yu being bullied. He decisively steps in to help. Although Ling Yu escapes, Lu Yunjie becomes a target of the bullying group. In a critical moment when he is caught, by a stroke of luck, he unintentionally gains a special superpower. With this newfound ability, Lu Yunjie embarks on a journey to fight against school bullying...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a GalGame that I and my two high school friends challenged ourselves to create within one month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game development process and records can be viewed on the following platforms:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili:\u6211\u662f\u767d\u6797\u90b1<br>Douyin:\u6211\u7cfb\u767d\u6797\u90b1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Thank you all very much for your support!</u></i></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151250/6544781a04074e4108f6213ec5c1c050a8778529.jpg"},{"name":"Hospitalized","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151250/43499ffe03d132d90802a599e54d6082a2afff29.jpg"},{"name":"Conquer Inner Demons!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151250/806aa8178fcb14ea432ea2303091946725438740.jpg"},{"name":"Caught in the Act (Sorrow)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3151250/5a43b7682cff931500180185fa15fd31ba049c0a.jpg"},{"name":"Ace Thief","path":"https://