 of standing up against school bullying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows Lu Yunjie, a middle school student who accidentally witnesses his classmate Ling Yu being bullied. He decisively steps in to help. Although Ling Yu escapes, Lu Yunjie becomes a target of the bullying group. In a critical moment when he is caught, by a stroke of luck, he unintentionally gains a special superpower. With this newfound ability, Lu Yunjie embarks on a journey to fight against school bullying...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a GalGame that I and my two high school friends challenged ourselves to create within one month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game development process and records can be viewed on the following platforms:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili:\u6211\u662f\u767d\u6797\u90b1<br>Douyin:\u6211\u7cfb\u767d\u6797\u90b1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Thank you all very much for your support!</u></i></strong></p>","developers":["Milton Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151250/header.jpg?t=1740457389","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3151250/825199/d6078c76dd683e70ecf1c64ce1959c7696ca8957/1750875433/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739044020","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3151250/825199/d6078c76dd683e70ecf1c64ce1959c7696ca8957/1750875433/dash_h264.mpd?t=1739044020","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3151250/825199/d6078c76dd683e70ecf1c64ce1959c7696ca8957/1750875433/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1739044020","id":257095931,"name":"Game","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095931/923975ee26a31539fe0c929b0986879846f74ea8/movie_600x337